Source common.tape
Output hero.gif
Hide
Type "tmux -L revamped-screens attach -t demo"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Sleep 800ms
Hide
Ctrl+]
Type@5ms "prefix M-a, Enter, q"
Enter
Show
Ctrl+B
Escape
Type@1ms "a"
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "q"
Sleep 2s
Hide
Ctrl+]
Type@5ms "prefix V"
Enter
Show
Ctrl+B
Type@1ms "V"
Sleep 3s
Hide
Ctrl+]
Type@5ms ":q Enter"
Enter
Show
Type ":q"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 2s
